      "golden_response": "Reference approach (passes all 9 cases):\n\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def productExceptSelf(self, nums: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n        n = len(nums)\n        out = [1] * n\n        left = 1\n        for i in range(n):\n            out[i] = left\n            left *= nums[i]\n        right = 1\n        for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n            out[i] *= right\n            right *= nums[i]\n        return out\n```",
